iner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b8c564 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4b8c564\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8107c48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8107c48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar20-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-430\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar20-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar20-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar20-100x100.jpg 100w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar20.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f046312 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f046312\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Monopompa</strong>, genellikle endüstriyel tesislerde kullanılan <strong>tek kademeli santrifüj pompa</strong> türüdür. Yüksek verimli sıvı transferi, basit yapısı ve düşük bakım ihtiyacı ile öne çıkar. Monopompa modelleri, özellikle <strong>su, kimyasal çözeltiler, yağ ve diğer akışkanların</strong> taşınmasında güvenilir performans sağlar.</p><p>HD Marine monopompalar; kompakt tasarım, dayanıklı yapı ve <strong>yüksek işletme verimliliği</strong> sayesinde endüstriyel proseslerde güçlü bir yardımcıdır.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80c3101 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"80c3101\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f3e18a1 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"f3e18a1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMonopompa Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6cae74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d6cae74\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Tek Kademeli Santrifüj</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">5 – 500 m³/h</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">6 – 16 bar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor Gücü</td><td width=\"329\">0.75 – 30 kW</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi</td><td width=\"329\">Döküm / Paslanmaz</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Bağlantı Çapı</td><td width=\"329\">1” – 6”</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">0°C – 120°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Koruma Sınıfı</td><td width=\"329\">IP55</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ae0786e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ae0786e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5045df0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5045df0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee9ea8a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ee9ea8a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d3e30b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3d3e30b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Nerelerde Kullanılır?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e02680d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e02680d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>HD Marine monopompalar şu alanlarda etkin çözümler sunar:</p><ul><li><strong>Su temini ve deşarj sistemleri</strong></li><li><strong>Kimyasal transfer uygulamaları</strong></li><li><strong>Soğutma sistemleri</strong></li><li><strong>Boya ve tekstil prosesleri</strong></li><li><strong>Makine ve ekipman devreleri</strong></li></ul><p>Bu uygulamalarda monopompa, verimli ve sürekli sıvı akışı sağlayarak proseslerin kesintisiz çalışmasına katkı sağlar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b68dd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"79b68dd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-905dcde elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"905dcde\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a24920512392\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-905dcde\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-0e327656a24920512392\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-0e327656a24920512392\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-0e327656a24920512392\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Monopompa nedir?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-arrow-circle-down